          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ക്ഷേത്രം (kṣētraṁ) from Sanskrit kṣētra, \"land, field; a sacred place\", taken over whole as a tatsama, with Malayalam's noun ending -ṁ (CDIAL 3735). Its first sense is \"land, a field\"; the holy ground became the temple."
            }
          ]
        },
